      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. so if companies are moving stuff closer to home or to 'allied' countries, does that mean the era of free trade is basically dead? like, is it better for a country to just focus on its own independence and control its own stuff rather than relying on these massive global networks?",
      "source": "evaluator"
